能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アロマの効果を受ける召喚ユニット以外の味方1体につき、自身の毎秒のSP回復量+8"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","香薰内的友军提升20% + 1%攻击力。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アロマ効果範囲内の味方の攻撃力+20% + 1%"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","速效愈合"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","即効薬"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为香薰内的友军恢复生命。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","アロマ効果範囲内の味方のHPを回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为香薰内的全体友军回复自身-90% − 10% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","アロマ効果範囲内の味方のHPをアクン&モンモンの-90% − 10% ATK分回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","回复量提升至-100% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","回復量が-100% − 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":4,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","回复量提升至-110% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","回復量が-110% − 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":4,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","回复量提升至-120% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","回復量が-120% − 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":4,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力，香薰内非召唤物友军数量不少于3个时进一步提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の攻撃力UP。アロマ効果範囲内の召喚ユニット以外の味方が3体以上の場合、追加で攻撃力UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高6%攻击力。当香薰内除自身以外的非召唤物友军数量不少于3个时，自身额外提升9%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+6%。アロマ効果範囲内の自身および召喚ユニット以外の味方が3体以上の場合、追加で自身の攻撃力+9%"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高8%攻击力。当香薰内除自身以外的非召唤物友军数量不少于3个时，自身额外提升12%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+8%。アロマ効果範囲内の自身および召喚ユニット以外の味方が3体以上の場合、追加で自身の攻撃力+12%"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高10%攻击力。当香薰内除自身以外的非召唤物友军数量不少于3个时，自身额外提升15%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+10%。アロマ効果範囲内の自身および召喚ユニット以外の味方が3体以上の場合、追加で自身の攻撃力+15%"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","枯萎药剂"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","枯凋の薬"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","香薰可以额外升级一次。满级后可对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","アロマをさらに1回強化できるようになる。3回目の強化でアロマは敵にダメージを与えるようになる"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“特制香薰”获得第三次升级效果：香薰的作用范围额外扩大1格。在“特制香薰”首次获得第三次升级时，香薰将会获得持续10秒的强化，每秒使香薰内的敌人流失12%最大生命值，这部分生命流失量最高不超过自身200%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「特製アロマ」が3回目の強化効果を獲得：アロマの効果範囲+1マス。「特製アロマ」で初めて3回目の強化効果を獲得した時、10秒間、毎秒効果範囲内の敵のHPがHP上限×12%分流失。毎秒HP流失量はアクン&モンモンの攻撃力×200%を超えない"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","香薰强化期间，每秒使敌人流失的最大生命值比例提高至14%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","敵の毎秒HP流失量がHP上限×14%にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","香薰强化期间，每次使敌人流失生命时，还会将其眩晕0.1秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アロマ強化期間中、範囲内の敵のHPが流失するたびに、0.1秒間、スタンになる"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","香薰强化期间，每秒使敌人流失的最大生命值比例提高至15%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","敵の毎秒HP流失量がHP上限×15%にUP"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“特制香薰”主动使用时的生命回复量提高。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","「特製アロマ」アクティブ効果のHP回復量UP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“特制香薰”主动使用时的生命回复量额外提高30% ATK 。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「特製アロマ」のアクティブ効果のHP回復量+30% ATK"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","摇摆香炉"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","ゆらゆら香爐"]]}